          <div style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.3);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;">
            <strong style="color:#34d399;font-size:0.92rem;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;">🎵 4. Parts &amp; Features of a Song (6 từ)</strong>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.86rem;line-height:1.6;">
              <li>Meaningful lyrics</li>
              <li>Chorus</li>
              <li>Melody</li>
              <li>A piece of music</li>
              <li>Catchy tune</li>
              <li>Massive hit / Big hit</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;">
            <strong style="color:#a78bfa;font-size:0.92rem;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;">❤️ 5. Music Preferences (5 từ)</strong>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.86rem;line-height:1.6;">
              <li>Be a big fan of</li>
              <li>Be into</li>
              <li>Favourite genre</li>
              <li>Taste in music</li>
              <li>Prefer live to recorded music</li>
            </ul>
