          <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;">
            <strong style="color:#f87171;font-size:0.92rem;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;">😌 6. Feelings &amp; Benefits (5 từ)</strong>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.86rem;line-height:1.6;">
              <li>Influence our emotions</li>
