    <!-- TAB 4: MAKE A COMPLETE ANSWER -->
    <section id="tab-act2" class="tab-panel">
      <div class="section-hero">
        <div class="hero-info">
          <span class="hero-badge-tag">Mục 4 – Speaking Practice</span>
          <h2>📝 Make A Complete Answer — 3 Levels</h2>
          <p>Bắt đầu từ Level 1 (dễ) và tiến lên Level 3. Dùng keywords gợi ý để xây dựng câu trả lời hoàn chỉnh bằng tiếng Anh.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-teal" onclick="triggerQuickTimer(45)">⏱️ Timer 45s</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="act2-controls">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="act2ShowAll()">👁️ Xem Tất Cả Đáp Án Mẫu</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="act2HideAll()">🙈 Ẩn Tất Cả Đáp Án</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="act2ClearAll()">🗑️ Xóa Tất Cả Câu Trả Lời</button>
      </div>

      <!-- LEVEL 1 -->
      <div class="level-section level-1">
        <div class="level-header">
          <span class="level-badge">Level 1</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff;">Personal Preferences</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 1</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Do you like music? What kind?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">like</span><span class="kw-pill">pop music</span><span class="kw-pill">favourite</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q1" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q1')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q1">Yes, I <span class="highlight-kw">like</span> music a lot. My <span class="highlight-kw">favourite</span> kind is <span class="highlight-kw">pop music</span> because the tunes are catchy and easy to enjoy.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 2</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Who is your favourite singer?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">favourite singer</span><span class="kw-pill">Vietnamese singer</span><span class="kw-pill">like</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q2" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q2')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q2">My <span class="highlight-kw">favourite singer</span> is a <span class="highlight-kw">Vietnamese singer</span>. I really <span class="highlight-kw">like</span> him because he has a warm voice and great stage energy.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 3</div>
          <div class="act2-question">What kind of music do you usually listen to?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">usually listen to</span><span class="kw-pill">pop music</span><span class="kw-pill">ballads</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q3" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q3')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q3">I <span class="highlight-kw">usually listen to</span> <span class="highlight-kw">pop music</span> and <span class="highlight-kw">ballads</span>. I love ballads because the melodies are gentle and the lyrics are touching.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 4</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Can you sing?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">sing</span><span class="kw-pill">karaoke</span><span class="kw-pill">friends</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q4" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q4')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q4">Not really well, but I enjoy singing at <span class="highlight-kw">karaoke</span> with my <span class="highlight-kw">friends</span>. I think <span class="highlight-kw">singing</span> is fun even if your voice isn't perfect.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 5</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Do you play any musical instruments?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">play</span><span class="kw-pill">guitar / piano</span><span class="kw-pill">a little</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q5" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q5')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q5">Yes, I can <span class="highlight-kw">play</span> the <span class="highlight-kw">guitar</span> <span class="highlight-kw">a little</span>. I taught myself online, so I only know a few basic songs.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LEVEL 2 -->
      <div class="level-section level-2">
        <div class="level-header">
          <span class="level-badge">Level 2</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff;">Habits, Reasons and Details</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 6</div>
          <div class="act2-question">How often do you listen to music?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">every day</span><span class="kw-pill">on my phone</span><span class="kw-pill">relax</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q6" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q6')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q6">I listen to music <span class="highlight-kw">every day</span> — usually <span class="highlight-kw">on my phone</span> with headphones. It helps me <span class="highlight-kw">relax</span> after a busy day at school.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 7</div>
          <div class="act2-question">When do you usually listen to music?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">after school</span><span class="kw-pill">listen to music</span><span class="kw-pill">unwind</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q7" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q7')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q7">I usually <span class="highlight-kw">listen to music</span> <span class="highlight-kw">after school</span> when I get home. It's a great way to <span class="highlight-kw">unwind</span> and clear my mind after studying all day.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 8</div>
          <div class="act2-question">What's your favourite song? What is it about?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">ballad</span><span class="kw-pill">meaningful lyrics</span><span class="kw-pill">beautiful melody</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q8" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q8')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q8">My favourite song is a slow <span class="highlight-kw">ballad</span> about growing up and missing home. It has very <span class="highlight-kw">meaningful lyrics</span> and a <span class="highlight-kw">beautiful melody</span> that always makes me feel calm.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 9</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Would you like to learn to play an instrument? Which one and why?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">piano</span><span class="kw-pill">beautiful sound</span><span class="kw-pill">relaxing</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q9" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q9')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q9">Yes, I would love to learn the <span class="highlight-kw">piano</span>. I think it has a really <span class="highlight-kw">beautiful sound</span> and playing it looks very <span class="highlight-kw">relaxing</span> and elegant.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 10</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Do you prefer listening to music alone or with other people?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">alone</span><span class="kw-pill">with friends</span><span class="kw-pill">sing along</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q10" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q10')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q10">I usually listen <span class="highlight-kw">alone</span> with my headphones because I can focus on the lyrics. However, listening <span class="highlight-kw">with friends</span> is more fun because we can <span class="highlight-kw">sing along</span> together.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LEVEL 3 -->
      <div class="level-section level-3">
        <div class="level-header">
          <span class="level-badge">Level 3</span>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff;">Explaining Opinions</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 11</div>
          <div class="act2-question">How does music influence our emotions?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">influence our emotions</span><span class="kw-pill">boost my mood</span><span class="kw-pill">relieve stress</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q11" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q11')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q11">I think music can <span class="highlight-kw">influence our emotions</span> very strongly. An upbeat song can <span class="highlight-kw">boost my mood</span> instantly, while a gentle melody can help me <span class="highlight-kw">relieve stress</span> after a long and tiring day.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 12</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Do you prefer live music or recorded music? Why?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">prefer live to recorded music</span><span class="kw-pill">exciting atmosphere</span><span class="kw-pill">sing along</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q12" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q12')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q12">Personally, I <span class="highlight-kw">prefer live to recorded music</span> because the <span class="highlight-kw">exciting atmosphere</span> of a concert is something you can never get from headphones. I love when the whole crowd <span class="highlight-kw">sings along</span> to every chorus together.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 13</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Has your taste in music changed over the years?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">used to</span><span class="kw-pill">be into</span><span class="kw-pill">taste in music</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q13" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q13')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q13">Yes, definitely. My <span class="highlight-kw">taste in music</span> has changed a lot. I <span class="highlight-kw">used to</span> only listen to children's songs, but now I am really <span class="highlight-kw">into</span> ballads and R&B because their lyrics feel more meaningful to me.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 14</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Why do some singers become very famous?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">catchy tunes</span><span class="kw-pill">a huge following</span><span class="kw-pill">massive hit</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q14" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q14')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q14">I think singers become famous when they release songs with <span class="highlight-kw">catchy tunes</span> that spread quickly on social media. Once a song becomes a <span class="highlight-kw">massive hit</span>, the artist gains <span class="highlight-kw">a huge following</span> almost overnight.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="act2-qcard">
          <div class="act2-qnum">Question 15</div>
          <div class="act2-question">Do you think music is important in people's lives? Why?</div>
          <div class="keywords-row"><span class="kw-pill">express feelings</span><span class="kw-pill">cheer people up</span><span class="kw-pill">relieve stress</span></div>
          <textarea class="act2-textarea" id="a2q15" placeholder="My answer: ..."></textarea>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost show-model-btn" onclick="toggleModel('m2q15')">💡 Show Model Answer</button>
          <div class="model-answer-box" id="m2q15">Absolutely. I believe music is extremely important because it allows people to <span class="highlight-kw">express their feelings</span> in a way that words alone cannot. It can <span class="highlight-kw">cheer people up</span> when they are sad and <span class="highlight-kw">relieve stress</span> after a difficult day.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
